* ARC token whitepaper\n(Circle, May 2026)
** Arc today
*** USDC native gas (18 decimals)
*** Malachite BFT + Reth
*** Permissioned PoA, round-robin proposer
*** Fees credited to proposer, no burn
** Five functions of ARC
*** Staking and economic security
*** Platform utility (gas and service discounts)
*** Fee capture (convert to ARC, split, burn)
*** Governance of economic parameters
*** Expanding utility surface
** Economics
*** 10 billion initial supply
*** Decaying inflation from 2-3%
*** Target: inflation neutrality
*** 60% ecosystem / 25% Circle / 15% reserve
